  Configuration                                                                           
  Toggle TUI settings (changes saved to config.toml)                                      
                                                                                          
  ▏› 1. Pinned Plan Drawer (off)                Pin plan updates to a drawer in the    ▕  
  ▏                                             viewport instead of history            ▕  
     2. Thoughts in History (on) (current)      Show agent thoughts in history, not       
                                                only in the working indicator             
     3. Resize Reflow (on) (current)            Reflow transcript history when the        
                                                terminal width changes                    
     4. Custom Working Messages (on) (current)  Rotate playful status messages while      
                                                the agent is working                      
     5. Vertical Footer (off)                   Stack footer segments vertically          
                                                instead of horizontally                   
     6. Terminal Notifications (on) (current)   Send OSC 9 escape sequences to notify     
                                                the terminal on events                    
     7. OS Notifications (on) (current)         Send native desktop notifications on      
                                                events                                    
     8. Vim Mode (off)                          Enable vim-style navigation in the        
                                                textarea (Escape enters normal mode)      
                                                                                          
  ↑/k ↓/j navigate, / search, enter confirm, esc go back
